    <briefdescription>
<para>System out of memory error. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classcslt_1_1OutOfMemoryError" kindref="compound">OutOfMemoryError</ref> represents an error when the system is completely out of memory or an allocator has reached its limit.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="par"><title>Example Usage:</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>OutOfMemoryError();<sp/><sp/>//<sp/>&quot;Out<sp/>of<sp/>memory&quot;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">throw<sp/>OutOfMemoryError(&quot;System<sp/>memory<sp/>exhausted&quot;);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
